    """
    Extracts the first name from a full name string based on specified parameters.

    :param full_name: The full name from which the first name is to be extracted.
    :param delimiter: The character used to separate names in the full name string, default is space.
    :param handle_special_characters: Flag to indicate if special characters should be handled, default is true.
    :param case_sensitive: Flag to indicate if the extraction should be case-sensitive, default is false.
